{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2021-12-17 11:47:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY TEXAS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'THE WOODLANDS, TEXAS, DEC. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ENTERGY TEXAS, INC. (NYSE: ETI-PR) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $0.3359375\xa0PER SHARE OF PREFERRED STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JAN. 15, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DEC. 30, 2021.'}